# Real captures off a real ring are personal data: sleep, heart rate and the
# ring's serial. They stay on the machine that captured them. The tests in this
# repository carry only synthetic bytes and vectors published by open_oura.
tests/fixtures/
captures/
*.qm

# The ring's app-auth key. It is the only secret in this project; the app keeps
# it in the Sailfish Secrets vault, and nothing should ever write it to a file
# inside the tree.
*.key
*.hex

